  "title": "Old-Fashioned Chicken and Dumplings",
  "description": "An old-fashioned chicken and dumplings recipe with rich gravy. This is comfort food at its best! Learn how to make this satisfying dish from scratch.",
  "authors": [
    "Karena"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-04-29T05:13:16-04:00",
