  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "7 pounds cut up chicken pieces",
    "4 cups chicken stock",
    "2 onions, chopped",
    "3 stalks celery, chopped",
    "2 teaspoons salt",
    "1 large egg",
    "0.25 cup milk",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour, divided",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "2 tablespoons cold unsalted butter",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh parsley",
    "1 cup water",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh parsley"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PlqGA_FMbV9cA6rO8ukQ9kQlMCk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-step1-3x4-2377-701c75c61a7947679e8e1c15a0d1c5b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start the soup: Place chicken pieces in a large pot; add chicken stock, onions, celery, and salt. Bring to a boil over medium-low heat, then simmer, partially covered, until chicken is tender, about 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3R5mV-cmqxV83I0h3cjaFb-8h7g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-step2-3x4-2382-744dc35dcf0e48d8947bded67bad124c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the dumplings: Beat egg and milk together in a large mixing bowl. Mix in 1 cup flour, baking powder, and salt.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ABy9fbDmrRI0XWcs8O-SwJQq0jU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-step3-3x4-2386-9149c41ef5e14b9f8d66a01c10372de8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grate cold butter into the wet flour mixture; stir in parsley.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hw_8x3UasFU2iV-D-245K5PZkM8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-step4-3x4-2390-33af3b951ec3479e94aa5c1c16b8cf94.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dollop 6 large spoonfuls of dumpling mixture onto the top of the simmering chicken. Cover the pot and steam dumplings until fluffy, 10 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/htYuQA_QPIuWVDwFhGWG5Vsvc70=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-step5-3x4-2395-796841dcb7444533b7eec24d75433ef2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove dumplings and chicken pieces to a large dish; shred chicken and discard bones. Cover and set aside, keeping warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UhxXk6-sRDq3UniqBy57_kvDSRk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-step7-3x4-2401-c0608c58e4a143b8af3d068f4423a6d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "For the gravy: Strain stock left in the pot, pressing the vegetables to release more flavor; return stock to the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yv87wkdzkLL9-fKHieE25pTBSc8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-step8-3x4-2402-02e049fbeb9b4911bdb6570bef27b268.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk water with remaining 1/2 cup flour until smooth; stir into the strained stock. Season with pepper and bring to a boil, stirring constantly, to thicken.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j-B0iDaVj2XR4V3iI37RMtF9YZs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-step8-3x4-2409-7246c4f060cd45c8aa5a8c942df963e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in chicken and top with dumplings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HHTUnUto7B2vozyO-ncU62fPEAs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-step8-3x4-2413-5b6c3d840a3d47b18d5a11f870dda5cc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with parsley and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LaddzMGxusIt7slPFQXmYTliwak=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15338-old-fashioned-chicken-and-dumplings-ddmfs-3x4-2419-83182dbe67224a509a8085a34d8438f7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15338/step_10.webp"
    }
  ],
